cdn.avbportal.com/images/d7089d7f-2bd5-42c2-83fe-431b5a4b95fa.jpg","label":"FLushFit Design Infographic"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/54690ac7-3804-4b17-b87b-238dc0e18d69.jpg","label":"Floor Status Indicator Infographic"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/9495eaa0-ea18-4d9a-87ad-b9e25fae2073.jpg","label":"ThinQ Auto Leak Infographic"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/8fcade81-9ee3-4420-8af7-fdc88c36445e.jpg","label":"QuadWash Pro Infographic"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/002e2fb4-f597-476d-b61e-b9d8b564016c.jpg","label":"Dynamic Heat Dry with AutoVent Dry Infographic"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/708d4acc-cefa-4874-8dd1-2bee1bf608ea.jpg","label":"Lifestyle"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/f927a349-1d68-46d2-8f8b-8d5fe89df576.jpg","label":"Controls"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/39fda87e-4d9d-415f-92b2-5ed2a4b76a83.jpg","label":"Top Open"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/abb270b4-bbd9-4b8d-9a58-d96de8d444dc.jpg","label":"Angle Open"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/88687a93-21ef-452d-a004-e3d7fe2f82b4.jpg","label":"Angle Rack Out"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/f8fd36d9-5b66-49ba-a9a3-691946cfa585.jpg","label":"Front Open Full"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/23d93bc4-3de5-47bf-9aab-23fcf5b4ccd3.jpg","label":"Angle Full"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/317eb437-82af-4c8e-92bf-b5da08cd8047.jpg","label":"Angle Rack Out Full"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/6466a08b-b3ec-4783-b2a8-40dccc7f4c68.jpg","label":"Side"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/0c8afb98-869c-4d0d-b370-00e584958688.jpg","label":"Side Rack Out FUll"},{"url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/images/e2ee50a7-dc50-4c36-a98f-f97471433ff5.jpg","label":"Back"}],"features":[{"type":"Headline","text":"Perfectly Flush for a Perfect Upgrade"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Flush appliance installation is among the hottest kitchen trends, but rest assured the sleek, integrated design of this LG dishwasher will remain timeless. LG fits your space while fitting an impressive 16 place settings in a single load. It's an instant kitchen upgrade."},{"type":"Headline","text":"LG's Leading 1-Hour Wash and Dry"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"LG's exclusive QuadWash® Pro and Dynamic Heat Dry™ technologies combine to deliver our leading 1-hour wash and dry cycle for sparkling, table-ready dishes in less time. So you can spend more time on what matters."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Pro-Level Cleaning Performance"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Tackle post-dinner cleanup like a pro with the enhanced cleaning power of QuadWash® Pro. High-pressure jets with 38% more cleaning power, spray dishes from multiple angles, while soaking them with over one million microbubbles to help break down stubborn food residue and provide exceptional cleaning performance."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Powerful Cleaning, Fewer Water Spots"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"LG TrueSteam® saves the time and headache of prewashing or rewashing dishes by hand. A blast of steam at the start of the cycle permeates and dissolves tough caked-on food but is gentle enough for your favorite wine glasses. A second blast during drying helps eliminate water spots by up to 60%—no more having to wipe spotty glasses before guests arrive."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Drier than Ever"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"The Dynamic Heat Dry™ technology circulates hot air throughout the dishwasher for faster, more complete drying. AutoVent™ Dry further adds to drying performance and energy efficiency by slightly opening the door at the end of the wash cycle to allow fresh air to circulate, delivering sparkling, table-ready dishes right off the rack."}],"documents":[{"label":"Specification Sheet","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/2cdc984d-ad5b-4508-a775-46a91a4f4713.pdf"},{"label":"Energy Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/f